   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »Zenit Measuring« Machine </h3> <h1> Professional Measurement of Cutter Heads </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Do you want to precisely adjust your planing and corner cutter heads to guarantee the accuracy and flatness of your workpieces? Do you want to extend the tool life of your tool cutting edges, thereby drastically reducing your production and tooling costs?</strong></p> <p>No problem with ZOLLER »zenit«: this high-precision presetting and measuring machine with an ergonomic seated workstation for all types of cutter heads and tools improves the quality of your workpieces and lowers costs.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
